+/**
+ * Replaces the value of the `value` of a close_to assertion for a given sub-node.
+ * For example: close_to:   { get.fields._routing: { value: 5.1, error: 0.00001 } }
+ * to           close_to:   { get.fields._routing: { value: 9.5, error: 0.00001 } }
